## Phase 2 — Backend: Seed Script (10,000 Employees)
**Commit:** `feat(backend): seed 10,000 employees with faker and exchange rate table`

- [ ] Install `@faker-js/faker`
- [ ] Create `backend/prisma/seed.ts`:
  - Seed `ExchangeRate` table by fetching daily rates from `fawazahmed0/exchange-api` (with hardcoded fallbacks: USD=1.0, GBP=1.27, EUR=1.08, INR=0.012 if the API is unreachable)
  - Generate 10,000 employees with realistic distribution:
    - Countries: US 40%, IN 30%, UK 20%, DE 10%
    - Departments: Engineering, Sales, Marketing, HR, Finance, Operations, Product
    - Employment type: Full-time 80%, Part-time 10%, Contractor 10%
    - Status: Active 90%, Inactive 10%
    - Salary ranges per country (local currency)
    - Unique emails, human-readable `EMP-XXXXX` IDs, realistic hire dates
  - Use `prisma.createMany` with batching for performance
- [ ] Add `"prisma": { "seed": "ts-node prisma/seed.ts" }` to `package.json`
- [ ] Run seed and verify 10,000 records in DB
- [ ] Add `backend/prisma/seed.ts` to git

